# apxinf-hip gemm recipe v1
# measured-on gfx1151 rocm7.1 hipblaslt100100
#
# Written by APXINF_HIP_GEMM_AUTOTUNE. One line per GEMM shape: the provider
# that measured faster, and for hipBLASLt the serialized algorithm it won with.
# Delete this file to re-tune; it is a cache, not a source.
#
# The epilogue column is part of the key: a shape can measure faster on
# hipBLAS as a plain GEMM and faster on hipBLASLt with the bias and
# activation fused in, because the fused form also deletes a kernel.
#
# dtype M K N epilogue provider [tactic]
bf16 10 1024 2560 none lt 341500000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
bf16 512 1152 72 none lt 3c1500000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
bf16 522 512 384 none lt 5d1500000000000000000000000000000000000000000000
